55	Professional plumbers your neighbours already trust.	about	about	About PipeCare	PipeCare started in 2014 with two plumbers and one promise: show up on time, explain the cost first and fix it properly. Today we are a team of 60 verified plumbers serving homes and businesses across Punjab and Chandigarh Tricity.	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568868053799-0728ed208ce4?w=2000&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900	t	About PipeCare — professional plumbing services in Punjab	Who we are, how our plumbers are trained and verified, and why thousands of families in Ludhiana, Chandigarh and Mohali trust PipeCare.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	{"sections":[{"layout":"text-image","eyebrow":"Our plumbers","heading":"Verified, trained and accountable","body":"<p>Every PipeCare plumber is background-verified, trained in our workshop on CPVC, UPVC, GI and sanitaryware work, and carries an ID card. You get the plumber\\u2019s name before the visit and a follow-up call after it.<\\/p>","image":"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1529836349180-223cd77d8cb6?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900"},{"layout":"image-text","eyebrow":"Quality commitment","heading":"Genuine parts, tested work, 30-day warranty","body":"<p>We use ISI-marked pipes and fittings and genuine spares from trusted brands. Every repair is pressure-tested before we leave, and if the same problem returns within 30 days we fix it free.<\\/p>","image":"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1503788943072-cd614c3056cf?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900"},{"layout":"text-image","eyebrow":"Our approach","heading":"Estimate first, then the work","body":"<p>No surprises. The plumber inspects, explains what is wrong, and quotes labour and parts before starting. For bigger jobs \\u2014 pipe replacement, new bathrooms, society tanks \\u2014 you get a written estimate.<\\/p>","image":"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1621905252472-943afaa20e20?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900"}],"values":[{"title":"On time","text":"Slots are confirmed on call and we tell you if we are running late."},{"title":"Transparent","text":"You approve the price before work begins. GST invoice on every job."},{"title":"Clean work","text":"We protect the area, clean up and take away old parts."},{"title":"Local","text":"Teams based in each city, so response times stay short."}],"sustainability_heading":"Every drop counts.","sustainability_body":"<p>A single dripping tap wastes over 5,000 litres a year. Fixing leaks fast, fitting water-efficient fixtures and cleaning tanks properly is our small part in saving water.<\\/p>","sustainability_image":"https:\\/\\/images.unsplash.com\\/photo-1669920282730-ab422e592f97?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900","founder_quote":"A plumber who explains the problem and the price before touching a pipe \\u2014 that is the company we wanted to build.","founder_name":"Jaspreet Singh, founder"}	plumbing-services
56	Talk to us	contact	contact	Contact	Call, WhatsApp or send a message — we reply within business hours and pick up emergencies round the clock.	\N	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564483335100-3413b45dbd37?w=1600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900	t	\N	Contact PipeCare Plumbing Services by phone, WhatsApp, email or the form. Emergency line open 24×7.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	\N	plumbing-services
57	Frequently asked questions	faq	faq	Help	Response times, service areas, estimates, warranty and payments.	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	\N	plumbing-services
58	Privacy policy	privacy	legal	\N	What we collect when you book a plumber, and how we use it.	<h3>What we collect</h3><p>Your name, phone number, address and problem description when you book, request a quote or contact us; your email if you share it.</p><h3>How we use it</h3><p>To dispatch and confirm your service visit, send updates about your booking and, if you opt in, tips and offers. We do not sell your data.</p><h3>Who can see it</h3><p>Our dispatch team and the plumber assigned to your job. Payment details are processed by the payment provider and never stored by us.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><p>Write to us to view, correct or delete your data.</p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	\N	plumbing-services
59	Terms of service	terms	legal	\N	Bookings, estimates, cancellations and warranty.	<h3>Bookings</h3><p>A booking is a request for a visit; the time is confirmed on call. Emergency visits may carry a visit charge which is told to you before dispatch.</p><h3>Estimates</h3><p>Work starts only after you approve the estimate. Additional work found during the job is quoted separately before it is done.</p><h3>Cancellation</h3><p>Cancel free of charge any time before the plumber is dispatched.</p><h3>Warranty</h3><p>Every job carries a 30-day work warranty as described on the warranty page. Parts carry the manufacturer warranty.</p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	\N	plumbing-services
60	Service warranty	warranty	legal	\N	Our 30-day work warranty, in plain language.	<h3>What is covered</h3><p>If the same problem we repaired returns within 30 days of the visit, we fix it again free of charge — labour and any part we supplied.</p><h3>What is not covered</h3><p>New problems, damage caused by others, parts supplied by the customer, and failures caused by water hammer, freezing or civil work after our visit.</p><h3>How to claim</h3><p>Call or WhatsApp with your booking reference. We schedule a revisit within 48 hours.</p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	\N	plumbing-services
61	Join the PipeCare team.	careers	careers	Careers	Plumbers, supervisors, dispatch and customer-support roles across Punjab and Chandigarh Tricity.	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:49:00	2026-09-21 09:49:00	{"roles":[{"title":"Plumber (residential)","location":"Ludhiana \\u00b7 Chandigarh \\u00b7 Mohali","type":"Full-time"},{"title":"Senior plumber \\/ site supervisor","location":"Ludhiana","type":"Full-time"},{"title":"Dispatch & customer support executive","location":"Ludhiana (office)","type":"Full-time"},{"title":"Apprentice plumber","location":"All cities","type":"Trainee"}],"perks":["Fixed salary plus per-job incentives","Tools, uniform and ID provided","Hands-on training in our workshop","Health insurance for you and your family"]}	plumbing-services
2	Shipping Information	shipping	legal	\N	How and when your order arrives.	<h3>Shipping methods</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Standard delivery</strong> — ₹250, complimentary over ₹15,000. Tracked courier, 3–5 business days.</li>\n<li><strong>Express delivery</strong> — ₹650, complimentary over ₹40,000. 1–2 business days to metro cities.</li>\n<li><strong>Collect in boutique</strong> — complimentary. Ready within 24 hours at Bengaluru, Mumbai or New Delhi.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Delivery timelines</h3>\n<p>Orders placed before 14:00 IST on a business day are dispatched the same day. Timelines are counted from dispatch and exclude Sundays and public holidays. Pre-order and made-to-measure pieces show their own estimated date on the product page.</p>\n<h3>Shipping charges</h3>\n<p>Charges are shown at checkout before you pay. There are no additional handling fees except a ₹99 fee for cash on delivery.</p>\n<h3>International shipping</h3>\n<p>We ship to over 40 countries with DHL Express in 5–10 business days. Duties and taxes are calculated and collected at checkout so nothing is due on delivery. Fragrances cannot be shipped to some destinations by air; checkout will let you know.</p>\n<h3>Order processing</h3>\n<p>You will receive a confirmation email when your order is placed and a second email with tracking when it is dispatched. Every piece is inspected, folded in tissue and packed in our ivory box.</p>\n<h3>Tracking</h3>\n<p>Use the tracking link in your dispatch email, sign in to your account, or visit <a href="/track-order">Track your order</a> with your order number and email.</p>\n<h3>Delays</h3>\n<p>Weather, customs or courier issues can occasionally delay delivery. If your order is more than three business days past its estimate, contact client care and we will investigate and, where appropriate, refund shipping.</p>\n<h3>Address changes</h3>\n<p>Addresses can be changed until the order is dispatched. Contact client care as soon as possible with your order number.</p>\n<h3>Lost or damaged packages</h3>\n<p>If your package arrives damaged, photograph the box and contents and contact us within 48 hours. If a tracked package is confirmed lost by the courier, we will replace it or refund you in full.</p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-16 04:51:11	2026-09-16 05:53:02	\N	fashion
3	Returns & Exchanges	returns	legal	\N	30 days, collected from your door, no charge.	<h3>Return eligibility</h3>\n<p>Any piece may be returned within 30 days of delivery provided it is unworn, unwashed, with all tags and packaging intact. Footwear must be tried on indoors and returned in its box.</p>\n<h3>Return window</h3>\n<p>30 days from the date of delivery. Gifts may be returned for store credit within 30 days of the original delivery date.</p>\n<h3>Exchange policy</h3>\n<p>Exchanges for another size or colour are complimentary. Request an exchange from your order page; the replacement is dispatched as soon as the original is collected.</p>\n<h3>Refund process and timelines</h3>\n<p>Once your return reaches our warehouse it is inspected within two business days. Refunds are issued to the original payment method and typically appear within 5–7 business days depending on your bank. Cash on delivery orders are refunded by bank transfer.</p>\n<h3>Non-returnable products</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fragrances that have been opened or unsealed</li>\n<li>Earrings, for hygiene reasons</li>\n<li>Gift cards</li>\n<li>Pieces altered or personalised at your request</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Damaged or incorrect products</h3>\n<p>If anything arrives damaged or is not what you ordered, contact client care within 48 hours with photographs. We will collect the item and send a replacement or full refund, including any shipping paid.</p>\n<h3>Return shipping</h3>\n<p>Returns within India are collected from your address at no charge. International returns are sent with the prepaid label included in your parcel; the original shipping fee is not refunded.</p>\n<h3>How to initiate a return</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Sign in and open the order under <a href="/account/orders">My orders</a>, or contact client care with your order number.</li>\n<li>Choose the items and reason. We will confirm a collection slot within 48 hours.</li>\n<li>Pack the pieces in the original packaging with the tags attached.</li>\n<li>Hand the parcel to the courier and keep the receipt until your refund is confirmed.</li>\n</ol>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-16 04:51:11	2026-09-16 05:53:02	{"cta_label":"Start a return","cta_url":"\\/account\\/orders"}	fashion
4	Privacy Policy	privacy	legal	\N	\N	<p>This policy explains what personal information Maison Élan collects, how we use it and the choices you have. It applies to our website, boutiques and client care.</p>\n<h3>Information we collect</h3>\n<p>Contact details (name, email, phone, addresses), order and payment information, account credentials, your communications with us, and technical data such as device, browser and pages visited.</p>\n<h3>How we use it</h3>\n<p>To fulfil and deliver orders, provide client care, personalise your experience, prevent fraud, improve the website and — with your consent — send marketing communications.</p>\n<h3>Cookies</h3>\n<p>We use essential cookies to run the site and, with your permission, analytics and marketing cookies. See our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details and controls.</p>\n<h3>Analytics</h3>\n<p>Aggregated, anonymised analytics help us understand how the site is used. Analytics cookies are only set if you accept them.</p>\n<h3>Payment information</h3>\n<p>Payments are processed by PCI-DSS certified providers. We receive confirmation of payment and the last four digits of your card; we never store full card numbers.</p>\n<h3>Third-party services</h3>\n<p>We share data only with providers who help us operate: couriers, payment processors, email services and analytics. Each is bound by contract to protect your data and use it only for our instructions.</p>\n<h3>Marketing communications</h3>\n<p>You will receive marketing emails only if you subscribe. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can change preferences in your account at any time.</p>\n<h3>Data security</h3>\n<p>Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, access is limited to staff who need it, and we review our safeguards regularly.</p>\n<h3>Your rights</h3>\n<p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data, object to processing, or ask for a portable copy. Email <a href="mailto:care@maisonelan.com">care@maisonelan.com</a> and we will respond within 30 days.</p>\n<h3>Data retention</h3>\n<p>Order records are kept for seven years to meet tax and legal obligations. Account data is kept while your account is active and deleted on request.</p>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<p>Maison Élan Private Limited, 12 Lavelle Road, Bengaluru 560001, India · <a href="mailto:care@maisonelan.com">care@maisonelan.com</a></p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-16 04:51:11	2026-09-16 05:53:02	\N	fashion
5	Terms & Conditions	terms	legal	\N	\N	<p>By using this website you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.</p>\n<h3>Website usage</h3>\n<p>You may use the site for personal, non-commercial purposes. You must not misuse it, attempt to gain unauthorised access, or use automated tools to scrape content.</p>\n<h3>Account registration</h3>\n<p>You are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for all activity under your account. Please tell us immediately if you suspect unauthorised use.</p>\n<h3>Product information</h3>\n<p>We take care to describe products accurately. Minor variations in colour and natural materials are not defects. Product availability is not guaranteed until an order is confirmed.</p>\n<h3>Pricing</h3>\n<p>Prices are in Indian Rupees and include GST unless stated. We may change prices at any time; the price shown at checkout is the price you pay. Obvious pricing errors may be corrected and affected orders cancelled with a full refund.</p>\n<h3>Orders</h3>\n<p>Your order is an offer to purchase. A contract is formed when we dispatch the goods. We may refuse or cancel orders for reasons including suspected fraud, stock errors or address problems.</p>\n<h3>Payments</h3>\n<p>Payment is taken when the order is placed. You confirm that you are authorised to use the payment method provided.</p>\n<h3>Intellectual property</h3>\n<p>All content — designs, photography, text, logos — belongs to Maison Élan or its licensors and may not be reproduced without written permission.</p>\n<h3>User content</h3>\n<p>By submitting reviews or messages you grant us a non-exclusive licence to use them. Content must be honest, lawful and respectful; we may remove content that is not.</p>\n<h3>Limitation of liability</h3>\n<p>To the extent permitted by law, our liability for any claim relating to an order is limited to the amount paid for that order. Nothing limits liability for death, personal injury or fraud.</p>\n<h3>Governing law</h3>\n<p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Bengaluru.</p>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<p>Maison Élan Private Limited, 12 Lavelle Road, Bengaluru 560001 · <a href="mailto:care@maisonelan.com">care@maisonelan.com</a></p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-16 04:51:11	2026-09-16 05:53:02	\N	fashion
6	Cookie Policy	cookies	cookies	\N	What cookies we use, why, and how to control them.	<h3>What cookies are</h3>\n<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your browser. They let a website remember your choices, keep you signed in and understand how the site is used.</p>\n<h3>Essential cookies</h3>\n<p>Required for the site to work: your session, shopping bag, sign-in state and security tokens. These cannot be switched off.</p>\n<h3>Analytics cookies</h3>\n<p>Help us understand which pages are used and where the site could be improved. Data is aggregated and anonymised. Set only with your consent.</p>\n<h3>Marketing cookies</h3>\n<p>Used to measure campaigns and show relevant content on other platforms. Set only with your consent.</p>\n<h3>Third-party cookies</h3>\n<p>Some cookies are set by partners such as analytics and payment providers. We only work with partners who meet our privacy standards.</p>\n<h3>Cookie preferences</h3>\n<p>Use the controls below to change your preferences at any time. You can also delete cookies through your browser settings.</p>	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	2026-09-16 04:51:11	2026-09-16 05:53:02	\N	fashion
