6	plumbing-services	Blocked Drain Repair	blocked-drain-repair	drain	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1654440122140-f1fc995ddb34?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=800	Repair of damaged, collapsed or root-blocked drain lines and traps.	<p>When cleaning alone does not hold, the pipe itself is the problem. We inspect the line, repair or replace the damaged section and refit traps and gullies so waste flows the way it should.</p>	["Blockage that keeps coming back","Drain line collapsed or broken","Sewage backing up","Roots in the outdoor line"]	["Line inspection","Section repair or replacement","Trap and gully replacement","Flow test and clean-up"]	[]	\N	f	f	t	5	\N	Repair of damaged, collapsed or root-blocked drain lines and traps.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:48:59	2026-09-21 09:48:59
1	plumbing-services	Emergency Plumbing	emergency-plumbing	alert	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526898943670-92bfa9f94c12?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=800	24×7 response for burst pipes, major leaks, overflowing drains and no-water situations.	<p>A plumbing emergency does not wait for office hours. Our emergency team is on call round the clock for burst pipes, major leakages, overflowing drains and sudden loss of water supply. We stop the damage first, then fix the cause properly.</p><p>While the plumber is on the way, our support team stays on the line to help you shut the main valve, isolate the geyser and contain the water.</p>	["Burst or cracked pipe","Water flooding the floor","Overflowing drain or toilet","Main line leak","No water supply at all"]	["Priority dispatch, day or night","Temporary fix to stop the damage","Permanent repair with genuine parts","Pressure test before we leave"]	[{"question":"How fast can you reach?","answer":"In most service areas an emergency plumber is at your door within 60\\u201390 minutes. Call us and we will guide you on the phone meanwhile."},{"question":"Are emergency charges higher?","answer":"Night and holiday visits carry a modest emergency visit charge which we tell you on the call before dispatching."}]	\N	t	t	t	0	\N	24×7 response for burst pipes, major leaks, overflowing drains and no-water situations.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:48:59	2026-09-21 09:48:59
2	plumbing-services	Leak Repair	leak-repair	droplet	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1676210134188-4c05dd172f89?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=800	Leak detection and repair for taps, joints, concealed pipes, ceilings and walls.	<p>Leaks waste water, damage walls and invite seepage in the flat below. Our plumbers locate the source — a worn washer, a failed joint or a cracked concealed pipe — and repair it with genuine parts, testing the line under pressure before leaving.</p>	["Dripping tap or shower","Damp patch on the wall or ceiling","Water under the sink or basin","Leak from a concealed pipe","Rising water bill with no visible leak"]	["Leak detection with pressure testing","Joint, washer and seal replacement","Concealed pipe repair with minimal breaking","Wall\\/ceiling patch coordination on request"]	[{"question":"Can you find a hidden leak without breaking tiles?","answer":"Usually yes \\u2014 we pressure-test each line and use moisture readings to narrow down the spot, so we open only the area that needs repair."}]	\N	f	t	t	1	\N	Leak detection and repair for taps, joints, concealed pipes, ceilings and walls.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:48:59	2026-09-21 09:48:59
3	plumbing-services	Pipe Repair	pipe-repair	pipe	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607472586893-edb57bdc0e39?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=800	Repair of cracked, corroded, leaking or noisy GI, CPVC, UPVC and PVC pipes.	<p>Whether it is an old GI line that has rusted through or a CPVC joint that has started to weep, we repair the affected section with the right material and fittings, and secure the run so the problem does not return.</p>	["Cracked or leaking pipe","Rusted GI pipe","Banging or vibrating pipes","Loose or leaking joint","Frozen or blocked section"]	["Inspection of the affected run","Section replacement or joint repair","Correct solvent cement and fittings","Clamping and support where needed"]	[]	\N	f	t	t	2	\N	Repair of cracked, corroded, leaking or noisy GI, CPVC, UPVC and PVC pipes.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:48:59	2026-09-21 09:48:59
4	plumbing-services	Pipe Replacement	pipe-replacement	layers	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545193329-4a052e14eb8f?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=800	Full or partial replacement of old water-supply and drainage lines with CPVC/UPVC/PVC.	<p>When repairs stop making sense, we replace the line. We survey the run, give you a written estimate for material and labour, and install a new line with ISI-marked pipes and fittings — tested under pressure and cleaned up before handover.</p>	["Repeated leaks on an old line","Rusty or discoloured water","Low pressure from clogged GI pipes","Renovation of an old house"]	["Line survey and material estimate","Removal of old pipes","New CPVC\\/UPVC\\/PVC line with ISI-marked fittings","Pressure testing and clean-up"]	[{"question":"How long does replacing a bathroom line take?","answer":"A single bathroom is usually done in one working day; a full house takes two to four days depending on the number of lines and civil work."}]	\N	f	f	t	3	\N	Full or partial replacement of old water-supply and drainage lines with CPVC/UPVC/PVC.	\N	\N	f	2026-09-21 09:48:59	2026-09-21 09:48:59
